<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2">  ]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2">}</span></span></code></pre></div></figure><p>Use the same credentials and regional base URL for the rest of the Public API.</p></div>
<h2 id="access-via-sdks" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#access-via-sdks">Access via SDKs</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<p>Both the Langfuse <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/observability/sdk/overview">Python SDK</a> and the <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/observability/sdk/overview">JS/TS SDK</a> provide a strongly-typed wrapper around our public REST API for your convenience. The API methods are accessible via the <code>api</code> property on the Langfuse client instance in both SDKs.</p>
<p>You can use your editor&#x27;s Intellisense to explore the API methods and their parameters. See <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/query-via-sdk">Query via SDKs</a> for more examples.</p>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners callout"><div class="bg-stripe-pattern callout-stripe-fade flex border p-4 gap-2 text-sm text-primary" style="--callout-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted));--stripe-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted))"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" class="size-4 mt-0.5 text-(--callout-color)"><g><path d="M7 12.25C9.8995 12.25 12.25 9.8995 12.25 7C12.25 4.10051 9.8995 1.75 7 1.75C4.10051 1.75 1.75 4.10051 1.75 7C1.75 9.8995 4.10051 12.25 7 12.25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.5625 6.5625C6.67853 6.5625 6.78981 6.60859 6.87186 6.69064C6.95391 6.77269 7 6.88397 7 7V9.1875C7 9.30353 7.04609 9.41481 7.12814 9.49686C7.21019 9.57891 7.32147 9.625 7.4375 9.625" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.78125 5.25C7.14369 5.25 7.4375 4.95619 7.4375 4.59375C7.4375 4.23131 7.14369 3.9375 6.78125 3.9375C6.41881 3.9375 6.125 4.23131 6.125 4.59375C6.125 4.95619 6.41881 5.25 6.78125 5.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-text-secondary text-[14px] prose-no-margin empty:hidden"><p>From Python SDK v4 and JS/TS SDK v5 onward, the high-performance observations and
metrics resources are the defaults: <code>api.observations</code> and <code>api.metrics</code>.
Scores API v3 is available as <code>api.scores_v3</code> in Python SDK <code>4.8.1+</code> and
<code>api.scoresV3</code> in JS/TS SDK <code>5.5.0+</code>; the <code>api.scores</code> v2 reads are deprecated
(<a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/faq/all/deprecated-api-migration#scores">migration guide</a>). Deprecated v1
resources moved under <code>api.legacy.*</code> (Python: <code>*_v1</code>, JS/TS: <code>*V1</code>). Python
SDK v5 and JS/TS SDK v6 have no <code>api.legacy</code> namespace: the legacy
observations and metrics read resources and <code>api.legacy.score_v1</code> /
<code>api.legacy.scoreV1</code> (including <code>create</code> and <code>delete</code>) are removed, as are the
<code>api.scores</code> v2 reads. In these versions, <code>api.scores</code> holds all score
endpoints: <code>api.scores.get_many</code> / <code>api.scores.getMany</code> reads Scores API v3,
next to <code>create</code> and <code>delete</code>, and <code>api.scores_v3</code> / <code>api.scoresV3</code> are
removed. Use <code>api.observations</code>, <code>api.metrics</code>, and <code>api.scores</code>
instead.</p><p>Observations API v2 and Metrics API v2 are available on Langfuse Cloud and
self-hosted Langfuse v4. On self-hosted Langfuse v3, use the <code>api.legacy.*</code>
resources. See <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/compatibility#sdk-server">Versions &amp; Compatibility</a>.</p></div></div></div></div>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners callout"><div class="bg-stripe-pattern callout-stripe-fade flex border p-4 gap-2 text-sm text-primary" style="--callout-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted));--stripe-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted))"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" class="size-4 mt-0.5 text-(--callout-color)"><g><path d="M7 12.25C9.8995 12.25 12.25 9.8995 12.25 7C12.25 4.10051 9.8995 1.75 7 1.75C4.10051 1.75 1.75 4.10051 1.75 7C1.75 9.8995 4.10051 12.25 7 12.25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.5625 6.5625C6.67853 6.5625 6.78981 6.60859 6.87186 6.69064C6.95391 6.77269 7 6.88397 7 7V9.1875C7 9.30353 7.04609 9.41481 7.12814 9.49686C7.21019 9.57891 7.32147 9.625 7.4375 9.625" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.78125 5.25C7.14369 5.25 7.4375 4.95619 7.4375 4.59375C7.4375 4.23131 7.14369 3.9375 6.78125 3.9375C6.41881 3.9375 6.125 4.23131 6.125 4.59375C6.125 4.95619 6.41881 5.25 6.78125 5.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-text-secondary text-[14px] prose-no-margin empty:hidden"><p>When fetching <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/prompts/get-started#use-prompt">prompts</a>, please use the <code>get_prompt</code> (Python) / <code>prompt.get</code> (JS/TS) methods on the Langfuse client to benefit from client-side caching, automatic retries, and fallbacks.</p></div></div></div></div>
<div><div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners"><div dir="ltr" data-orientation="horizontal" class="border bg-fd-secondary flex overflow-hidden flex-col my-0 rounded-none border-none"><div role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="text-fd-secondary-foreground not-prose flex overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden flex-nowrap gap-2 px-4 pt-1 rounded-none border-b sm:gap-4 not-prose border-line-structure min-h-9 bg-surface-bg" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" style="outline:none"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="radix-_R_3edklubt6cnql5b_-content-python-sdk" data-state="active" id="radix-_R_3edklubt6cnql5b_-trigger-python-sdk" class="py-2 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-none border-b border-transparent pb-2 pt-1.5 text-xs text-text-tertiary transition-colors font-[430] hover:text-foreground cursor-pointer disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 data-[state=active]:border-line-cta data-[state=active]:text-text-primary data-[state=active]:font-medium" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item="">Python SDK</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="radix-_R_3edklubt6cnql5b_-content-js/ts-sdk" data-state="inactive" id="radix-_R_3edklubt6cnql5b_-trigger-js/ts-sdk" class="py-2 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-none border-b border-transparent pb-2 pt-1.5 text-xs text-text-tertiary transition-colors font-[430] hover:text-foreground cursor-pointer disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 data-[state=active]:border-line-cta data-[state=active]:text-text-primary data-[state=active]:font-medium" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item="">JS/TS SDK</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="radix-_R_3edklubt6cnql5b_-content-java-sdk" data-state="inactive" id="r