<h2 id="ingest-traces" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#ingest-traces">Ingest traces via the API</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners callout"><div class="bg-stripe-pattern callout-stripe-fade flex border p-4 gap-2 text-sm text-primary" style="--callout-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted));--stripe-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted))"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" class="size-4 mt-0.5 text-(--callout-color)"><g><path d="M7 12.25C9.8995 12.25 12.25 9.8995 12.25 7C12.25 4.10051 9.8995 1.75 7 1.75C4.10051 1.75 1.75 4.10051 1.75 7C1.75 9.8995 4.10051 12.25 7 12.25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.5625 6.5625C6.67853 6.5625 6.78981 6.60859 6.87186 6.69064C6.95391 6.77269 7 6.88397 7 7V9.1875C7 9.30353 7.04609 9.41481 7.12814 9.49686C7.21019 9.57891 7.32147 9.625 7.4375 9.625" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.78125 5.25C7.14369 5.25 7.4375 4.95619 7.4375 4.59375C7.4375 4.23131 7.14369 3.9375 6.78125 3.9375C6.41881 3.9375 6.125 4.23131 6.125 4.59375C6.125 4.95619 6.41881 5.25 6.78125 5.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-text-secondary text-[14px] prose-no-margin empty:hidden"><p>The OpenTelemetry endpoint is the supported path for trace ingestion. The
legacy Ingestion API is deprecated and is sunset on Langfuse Cloud on <strong>November 16, 2026</strong> (<code>2026-11-16</code>)<!-- -->; on self-hosted v4 it is unavailable once you run
the default <code>events_only</code> write mode. Switch to the OpenTelemetry endpoint
now. Follow the <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/integrations/native/opentelemetry/migration-to-v4">custom ingestion migration
guide</a> to map legacy
events to v4-ready OTEL spans. This deprecation applies to trace and
observation events. Current SDK score helpers send <code>score-create</code> events to
the same endpoint; those events remain supported after the cutover.</p></div></div></div></div>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://api.reference.langfuse.com/#tag/opentelemetry/POST/api/public/otel/v1/traces" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal">OpenTelemetry Traces Ingestion Endpoint</a> implements the OTLP/HTTP specification for trace ingestion, providing native OpenTelemetry integration for Langfuse Observability.</li>
<li>(Sunset as of <!-- -->Nov 16, 2026<!-- -->) <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/faq/all/deprecated-api-migration#ingestion">Ingestion API</a> allows trace ingestion using an API.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="retrieve-data" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#retrieve-data">Retrieve data via the API</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<p>For new data extraction workflows, use the high-performance read APIs below. Each is designed around cursor-based pagination and selective field retrieval so you only fetch the columns you need.</p>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners"><div class="overflow-auto w-full"><table class="my-0! w-full h-full text-sm caption-bottom border-none"><thead><tr><th>To retrieve...</th><th>Use</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Row-level <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/observability/data-model#observations-traces-and-sessions">observations</a> (spans, generations, events)</td><td><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="#v2">Observations API v2</a></td></tr><tr><td>Score data (evaluations, annotations, API-ingested)</td><td><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="#v3">Scores API v3</a></td></tr><tr><td>Experiment runs and items</td><td><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="#experiments">Experiments API</a></td></tr><tr><td>Aggregated analytics (cost, usage, latency, volume)</td><td><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/metrics/features/metrics-api#v2">Metrics API v2</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners callout"><div class="bg-stripe-pattern callout-stripe-fade flex border p-4 gap-2 text-sm text-primary" style="--callout-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted));--stripe-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted))"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" class="size-4 mt-0.5 text-(--callout-color)"><g><path d="M7 12.25C9.8995 12.25 12.25 9.8995 12.25 7C12.25 4.10051 9.8995 1.75 7 1.75C4.10051 1.75 1.75 4.10051 1.75 7C1.75 9.8995 4.10051 12.25 7 12.25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.5625 6.5625C6.67853 6.5625 6.78981 6.60859 6.87186 6.69064C6.95391 6.77269 7 6.88397 7 7V9.1875C7 9.30353 7.04609 9.41481 7.12814 9.49686C7.21019 9.57891 7.32147 9.625 7.4375 9.625" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.78125 5.25C7.14369 5.25 7.4375 4.95619 7.4375 4.59375C7.4375 4.23131 7.14369 3.9375 6.78125 3.9375C6.41881 3.9375 6.125 4.23131 6.125 4.59375C6.125 4.95619 6.41881 5.25 6.78125 5.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-text-secondary text-[14px] prose-no-margin empty:hidden"><p>The deprecated trace, observation, score, and metrics read APIs are documented, with migration steps, in <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/faq/all/deprecated-api-migration">Migration of deprecated APIs</a>. Always include a bounded time range (e.g. <code>fromStartTime</code>/<code>toStartTime</code>) to keep each request fast.</p></div></div></div></div>
<h3 id="v2" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#v2">Observations API v2</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h3>
<div class="my-4 border relative border-line-structure bg-surface-bg"><div class="flex list-none items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 text-text-primary with-stripes border-b border-line-structure">Where is this feature available?</div><ul class="grid justify-between px-0! my-0! divide-y md:divide-x md:divide-y-0 md:grid-cols-5 grid-cols-1 not-prose"><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Hobby</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Core</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Pro</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Enterprise</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Self Hosted</div><span class="text-xs">Langfuse v4+</span></li></ul></div>
<p>Retrieve <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/observability/data-model#observations-traces-and-sessions">observation</a> data (spans, generations, events) for custom workflows, evaluation pipelines, and analytics. For aggregated metrics (total cost, token counts, trace volumes grouped by user, model, or time period), use the <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/metrics/features/metrics-api">Metrics API</a> instead of fetching and aggregating raw rows yourself.</p>
<figure dir="ltr" class="my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes Monokai Pro Light monokai" style="--shiki-light:#2d2a2e;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2;--shiki-light-bg:#fafaf8;--shiki-dark-bg:#272822" tabindex="-1"><div class="empty:hidden absolute top-3 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground" aria-label="Copy Text"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path></svg></button></div><div role="region" tabindex="0" class="text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring" style="--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)"><pre class="min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col"><code><span class="line"><span>GET /api/public/v2/observations</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners callout"><div class="bg-stripe-pattern callout-stripe-fade flex border p-4 gap-2 text-sm text-primary" style="--callout-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted));--stripe-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted))"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" class="size-4 mt-0.5 text-(--callout-color)"><g><path d="M7 12.25C9.8995 12.25 12.25 9.8995 12.25 7C12.25 4.10051 9.8995 1.75 7 1.75C4.10051 1.75 1.75 4.10051 1.75 7C1.75 9.8995 4.10051 12.25 7 12.25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.5625 6.5625C6.67853 6.5625 6.78981 6.60859 6.87186 6.69064C6.95391 6.77269 7 6.88397 7 7V9.1875C7 9.30353 7.04609 9.41481 7.12814 9.49686C7.21019 9.57891 7.32147 9.625 7.4375 9.625" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.78125 5.25C7.14369 5.25 7.4375 4.95619 7.4375 4.59375C7.4375 4.23131 7.14369 3.9375 6.78125 3.9375C6.41881 3.9375 6.125 4.23131 6.125 4.59375C6.125 4.95619 6.41881 5.25 6.78125 5.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-text-secondary text-[14px] prose-no-margin empty:hidden"><p><strong>Data availability:</strong> Data from older SDKs (<code>langfuse-python</code> &lt; <code>4.7.0</code>, <code>langfuse-js</code> &lt; <code>5.4.0</code>) or direct OpenTelemetry exporters that do not send <code>x-langfuse-ingestion-version: 4</code> can be delayed by up to 15 minutes on v2 endpoints. Upgrade to <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/observability/sdk/upgrade-path/python-v3-to-v4">Python SDK v4.7.0+</a> or <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/observability/sdk/upgrade-path/js-v4-to-v5">JS/TS SDK v5.4.0+</a>, or <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/integrations/native/opentelemetry#real-time-ingestion">set that header on your OTEL span exporter</a> to see new data in real time. Details: <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/compatibility#faq-delay">Versions &amp; Compatibility</a>.</p><p>On self-hosted Langfuse v3, use the v1 Observations API (<code>GET /api/public/observations</code>) instead; see the <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/upgrade/versioning#sdk-server">self-hosted compatibility matrix</a>.</p></div></div></div></div>
<p>The v2 Observations API is redesigned for high-performance retrieval, minimizing the work Langfuse performs per query. See the <a href="https://api.reference.langfuse.com/#tag/observations/GET/api/public/v2/observations" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal">v2 Observations API reference</a> for the full parameter and response schema.</p>
<h4 id="upgrade-from-older-reads" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#upgrade-from-older-reads">Upgrade from older trace and observation reads</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4>
<p>The <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/faq/all/deprecated-api-migration">migration guide</a> maps every deprecated read endpoint (<code>/api/public/traces</code>, <code>/api/public/observations</code>, <code>/api/public/sessions</code>, ...) to its v2 replacement, with parameter mappings and before/after examples. Always include <code>fromStartTime</code> and <code>toStartTime</code> to keep each request bounded.</p>
<p>The v2 Observations API returns observation rows, not full trace objects. Group rows by <code>traceId</code> when you need to reconstruct trace activity, and use <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/metrics/features/metrics-api#v2">Metrics API v2</a> for aggregate reporting with trace-level dimensions such as <code>traceName</code>, <code>traceRelease</code>, or <code>traceVersion</code>. There is no get-by-id route on v2; for single-observation lookups, pass a URL-encoded <code>filter</code> condition on the <code>id</code> column instead.</p>
<h4 id="logical-root-observations" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#logical-root-observations">Logical root observations</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4>
<p>The v2 API distinguishes physical parentage from logical root status:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>parentObservationId</code> identifies the physical parent observation. An empty value matches observations without a physical parent.</li>
<li><code>isRootObservation</code> is <code>true</code> when an observation has no physical parent or the SDK explicitly marked it as an application root.</li>
</ul>
<p>An application-root observation can therefore have <code>isRootObservation: true</code> and a non-null <code>parentObservationId</code>. Use <code>isRootObservation</code> when you want application roots, and <code>parentObservationId</code> when you need to query the physical observation tree.</p>
<p>The logical-root filter assumes one exported application root per trace. If a trace has no exported root in this project — for example, its root lives in another service — <code>isRootObservation = true</code> will not match it; group by <code>traceId</code> when you need complete trace counts. Multiple matching roots indicate an integration issue.</p>
<h4 id="field-groups" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#field-groups">Selective field retrieval</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4>
<p>Rather than returning every column on every row, the v2 API lets you request only the field groups you need as a comma-separated string:</p>
<figure dir="ltr" class="my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes Monokai Pro Light monokai" style="--shiki-light:#2d2a2e;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2;--shiki-light-bg:#fafaf8;--shiki-dark-bg:#272822" tabindex="-1"><div class="empty:hidden absolute top-3 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground" aria-label="Copy Text"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path></svg></button></div><div role="region" tabindex="0" class="text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring" style="--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)"><pre class="min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col"><code><span class="line"><span>?fields=core,basic,usage</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners"><div class="overflow-auto w-full"><table class="my-0! w-full h-full text-sm caption-bottom border-none"><thead><tr><th>Group</th><th>Fields</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>core</code></td><td>Always included: id, traceId, startTime, endTime, projectId, parentObservationId, type</td></tr><tr><td><code>basic</code></td><td>name, level, statusMessage, version, environment, bookmarked, public, userId, sessionId, isRootObservation</td></tr><tr><td><code>time</code></td><td>completionStartTime, createdAt, updatedAt</td></tr><tr><td><code>io</code></td><td>input, output</td></tr><tr><td><code>metadata</code></td><td>metadata</td></tr><tr><td><code>model</code></td><td>model, internalModelId, modelParameters</td></tr><tr><td><code>usage</code></td><td>usageDetails, inputUsage, outputUsage, totalUsage, costDetails, inputCost, outputCost, totalCost, usagePricingTierName</td></tr><tr><td><code>prompt</code></td><td>promptId, promptName, promptVersion</td></tr><tr><td><code>metrics</code></td><td>latency, timeToFirstToken</td></tr><tr><td><code>trace_context</code></td><td>tags, release, traceName</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<p>If <code>fields</code> is not specified, <code>core</code> and <code>basic</code> are returned by default. Fields from groups you do not request are <strong>absent</strong> from the response, not <code>null</code>. The exception is <code>modelId</code>, <code>inputPrice</code>, <code>outputPrice</code>, and <code>totalPrice</code>, which are always present but only populated when the <code>model</code> group is selected. <code>inputPrice</code>, <code>outputPrice</code>, and <code>totalPrice</code> are returned as <strong>strings</strong> (e.g. <code>&quot;0.000005&quot;</code>) to preserve decimal precision; cast them to a numeric type in your pipeline.</p>
<p>The v2 API also returns I/O as raw strings instead of always parsing them as JSON; parse them in your pipeline when needed. (The <code>parseIoAsJson</code> parameter is deprecated: omit it or set it to <code>false</code>; <code>true</code> returns a <code>400</code>.)</p>
<h4 id="observations-filters" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#observations-filters">Query parameters and filters</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4>
<p>Requests need an API key with read access to traces. Bound every request with <code>fromStartTime</code> and <code>toStartTime</code>. The fixed parameters cover the common cases:</p>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners"><div class="overflow-auto w-full"><table class="my-0! w-full h-full text-sm caption-bottom border-none"><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Matches</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>fromStartTime</code></td><td>ISO 8601 datetime</td><td><code>startTime &gt;=</code> value</td></tr><tr><td><code>toStartTime</code></td><td>ISO 8601 datetime</td><td><code>startTime &lt;</code> value</td></tr><tr><td><code>traceId</code></td><td>string</td><td>Observations of one trace</td></tr><tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>Exact observation name</td></tr><tr><td><code>type</code></td><td>enum</td><td><code>GENERATION</code>, <code>SPAN</code>, <code>EVENT</code>, <code>AGENT</code>, <code>TOOL</code>, <code>CHAIN</code>, <code>RETRIEVER</code>, <code>EVALUATOR</code>, <code>EMBEDDING</code>, <code>GUARDRAIL</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>level</code></td><td>enum</td><td><code>DEBUG</code>, <code>DEFAULT</code>, <code>WARNING</code>, <code>ERROR</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>userId</code>, <code>sessionId</code></td><td>string</td><td>Exact match on the trace&#x27;s user or session</td></tr><tr><td><code>environment</code></td><td>string, repeatable</td><td>Any of the given environments</td></tr><tr><td><code>version</code></td><td>string</td><td>Exact match</td></tr><tr><td><code>parentObservationId</code></td><td>string</td><td>Physical parent; an empty value matches observations without a parent</td></tr><tr><td><code>isRootObservation</code></td><td><code>true</code> / <code>false</code></td><td>Logical root status, see <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="#logical-root-observations">above</a></td></tr><tr><td><code>fields</code></td><td>comma-separated field groups</td><td>Which <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="#field-groups">field groups</a> to return</td></tr><tr><td><code>expandMetadata</code></td><td>comma-separated keys</td><td>Metadata keys to return untruncated (values are otherwise cut at 200 characters)</td></tr><tr><td><code>limit</code>, <code>cursor</code></td><td>int (≤ 1,000), string</td><td><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="#observations-pagination">Pagination</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<p>Everything else — tags, cost, latency, token counts, model, prompt, input/output text, metadata by key, negations, and multi-value matches — goes through the <code>filter</code> parameter: a URL-encoded JSON array of conditions with the same columns and operators the filter bar in the Langfuse UI uses. When <code>filter</code> is present it takes precedence over the fixed parameters above.</p>
<p>Each condition is <code>{&quot;type&quot;, &quot;column&quot;, &quot;operator&quot;, &quot;value&quot;}</code> (plus <code>&quot;key&quot;</code> for metadata). Columns include <code>id</code>, <code>type</code>, <code>name</code>, <code>traceId</code>, <code>traceName</code>, <code>startTime</code>, <code>endTime</code>, <code>environment</code>, <code>level</code>, <code>statusMessage</code>, <code>version</code>, <code>userId</code>, <code>sessionId</code>, <code>isRootObservation</code>, <code>tags</code>, <code>latency</code>, <code>timeToFirstToken</code>, <code>tokensPerSecond</code>, <code>inputTokens</code>, <code>outputTokens</code>, <code>totalTokens</code>, <code>inputCost</code>, <code>outputCost</code>, <code>totalCost</code>, <code>model</code>, <code>promptName</code>, <code>promptVersion</code>, <code>input</code>, <code>output</code>, and <code>metadata</code>. The operators depend on the condition type:</p>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners"><div class="overflow-auto w-full"><table class="my-0! w-full h-full text-sm caption-bottom border-none"><thead><tr><th><code>type</code></th><th>Operators</th><th>Typical columns</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>=</code>, <code>contains</code>, <code>does not contain</code>, <code>starts with</code>, <code>ends with</code></td><td><code>name</code>, <code>traceName</code>, <code>userId</code>, <code>sessionId</code>, <code>model</code>, …</td></tr><tr><td><code>stringOptions</code></td><td><code>any of</code>, <code>none of</code></td><td><code>type</code>, <code>level</code>, <code>environment</code>, <code>promptName</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>arrayOptions</code></td><td><code>any of</code>, <code>none of</code>, <code>all of</code></td><td><code>tags</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>number</code></td><td><code>=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code></td><td><code>latency</code>, <code>totalCost</code>, <code>totalTokens</code>, …</td></tr><tr><td><code>datetime</code></td><td><code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code></td><td><code>startTime</code>, <code>endTime</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>=</code>, <code>&lt;&gt;</code></td><td><code>isRootObservation</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>stringObject</code></td><td>as <code>string</code>, with <code>key</code> naming the metadata field; values are compared as strings</td><td><code>metadata</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>null</code></td><td><code>is null</code>, <code>is not null</code></td><td>any nullable column</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<p><code>input</code> and <code>output</code> conditions support <code>=</code> or <code>matches</code> (full-text search); substring operators such as <code>contains</code>, <code>starts with</code>, and <code>ends with</code> are rejected for these columns. Each request that filters these fields must include at least one <code>=</code> or <code>matches</code> condition. There is no fixed <code>tags</code> parameter: filter tags with <code>{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;arrayOptions&quot;,&quot;column&quot;:&quot;tags&quot;,&quot;operator&quot;:&quot;any of&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:[&quot;prod&quot;]}</code>. A filter-bar expression such as <em>name does not contain &quot;healthcheck&quot;</em> translates to:</p>
<figure dir="ltr" class="my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes Monokai Pro Light monokai" style="--shiki-light:#2d2a2e;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2;--shiki-light-bg:#fafaf8;--shiki-dark-bg:#272822" tabindex="-1"><div class="empty:hidden absolute top-3 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground" aria-label="Copy Text"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path></svg></button></div><div role="region" tabindex="0" class="text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring" style="--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)"><pre class="min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#78A855;--shiki-dark:#A6E22E">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> -G</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF">  -H</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74"> &quot;Authorization: Basic &lt;BASIC AUTH HEADER&gt;&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74">  &quot;https://cloud.langfuse.com/api/public/v2/observations&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF">  --data-urlencode</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74"> &#x27;fromStartTime=2025-12-15T00:00:00Z&#x27;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF">  --data-urlencode</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74"> &#x27;toStartTime=2025-12-16T00:00:00Z&#x27;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF">  --data-urlencode</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74"> &#x27;filter=[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;string&quot;,&quot;column&quot;:&quot;name&quot;,&quot;operator&quot;:&quot;does not contain&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;healthcheck&quot;}]&#x27;</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>
<p>The complete list of columns and operators per type is in the <a href="https://api.reference.langfuse.com/#tag/observations/GET/api/public/v2/observations" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal">API reference</a> under the <code>filter</code> parameter.</p>
<h4 id="observations-pagination" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#observations-pagination">Cursor-based pagination</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4>
<p>Instead of offset-based page numbers, the v2 API paginates with a cursor for consistent performance on large datasets:</p>
<ol>
<li>Make your initial request with a <code>limit</code> parameter (default 50, max 1,000 — up from the v1 maximum of 100).</li>
<li>If more results exist, the response includes a <code>cursor</code> in the <code>meta</code> object.</li>
<li>Pass this cursor via the <code>cursor</code> parameter in your next request to continue where you left off.</li>
<li>Repeat until no <code>cursor</code> is returned (or <code>meta.cursor</code> is <code>null</code>) — you&#x27;ve reached the end.</li>
</ol>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners callout"><div class="bg-stripe-pattern callout-stripe-fade flex border p-4 gap-2 text-sm text-primary" style="--callout-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted));--stripe-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted))"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" class="size-4 mt-0.5 text-(--callout-color)"><g><path d="M7 12.25C9.8995 12.25 12.25 9.8995 12.25 7C12.25 4.10051 9.8995 1.75 7 1.75C4.10051 1.75 1.75 4.10051 1.75 7C1.75 9.8995 4.10051 12.25 7 12.25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.5625 6.5625C6.67853 6.5625 6.78981 6.60859 6.87186 6.69064C6.95391 6.77269 7 6.88397 7 7V9.1875C7 9.30353 7.04609 9.41481 7.12814 9.49686C7.21019 9.57891 7.32147 9.625 7.4375 9.625" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.78125 5.25C7.14369 5.25 7.4375 4.95619 7.4375 4.59375C7.4375 4.23131 7.14369 3.9375 6.78125 3.9375C6.41881 3.9375 6.125 4.23131 6.125 4.59375C6.125 4.95619 6.41881 5.25 6.78125 5.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-text-secondary text-[14px] prose-no-margin empty:hidden"><p><code>limit</code> is a maximum. A page may contain fewer observations, including none,
while <code>meta.cursor</code> is present. Continue using the cursor even when <code>data</code> is
empty; the page length does not indicate completion.</p></div></div></div></div>
<p>Results are always sorted by <code>startTime</code> descending (newest first).</p>
<p>On Langfuse Cloud, requests count toward the general per-organization API rate limit (see the <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/faq/all/api-limits">API limits FAQ</a>). Self-hosted instances have no enforced rate limits.</p>
<h4 id="observations-examples" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#observations-examples">Examples</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4>
<p>Get observations for a specific trace, then paginate with the returned cursor:</p>
<figure dir="ltr" class="my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes Monokai Pro Light monokai" style="--shiki-light:#2d2a2e;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2;--shiki-light-bg:#fafaf8;--shiki-dark-bg:#272822" tabindex="-1"><div class="empty:hidden absolute top-3 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground" aria-label="Copy Text"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path></svg></button></div><div role="region" tabindex="0" class="text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring" style="--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)"><pre class="min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#9D9D9D;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#88846F;--shiki-dark-font-style:inherit"># Fetch a page for one trace</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#78A855;--shiki-dark:#A6E22E">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF">  -H</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74"> &quot;Authorization: Basic &lt;BASIC AUTH HEADER&gt;&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74">  &quot;https://cloud.langfuse.com/api/public/v2/observations?fields=core,basic,usage&amp;traceId=your-trace-id&amp;limit=100&quot;</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#9D9D9D;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#88846F;--shiki-dark-font-style:inherit"># Response includes: &quot;meta&quot;: { &quot;cursor&quot;: &quot;eyJsYXN0...&quot; }</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#9D9D9D;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#88846F;--shiki-dark-font-style:inherit"># Pass it back to fetch the next page</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#78A855;--shiki-dark:#A6E22E">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF">  -H</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74"> &quot;Authorization: Basic &lt;BASIC AUTH HEADER&gt;&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74">  &quot;https://cloud.langfuse.com/api/public/v2/observations?fields=core,basic,usage&amp;traceId=your-trace-id&amp;limit=100&amp;cursor=eyJsYXN0...&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>
<p>Filter for logical roots with the first-class query parameter:</p>
<figure dir="ltr" class="my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes Monokai Pro Light monokai" style="--shiki-light:#2d2a2e;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2;--shiki-light-bg:#fafaf8;--shiki-dark-bg:#272822" tabindex="-1"><div class="empty:hidden absolute top-3 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground" aria-label="Copy Text"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path></svg></button></div><div role="region" tabindex="0" class="text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring" style="--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)"><pre class="min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#78A855;--shiki-dark:#A6E22E">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF">  -H</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74"> &quot;Authorization: Basic &lt;BASIC AUTH HEADER&gt;&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74">  &quot;https://cloud.langfuse.com/api/public/v2/observations?isRootObservation=true&amp;fromStartTime=2025-12-15T00:00:00Z&amp;toStartTime=2025-12-16T00:00:00Z&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>
<p>The advanced <code>filter</code> parameter supports the same field with boolean <code>=</code> and <code>&lt;&gt;</code> operators, e.g. a URL-encoded JSON value of <code>[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;boolean&quot;,&quot;column&quot;:&quot;isRootObservation&quot;,&quot;operator&quot;:&quot;=&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}]</code>.</p>
<h3 id="v3" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#v3">Scores API v3</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h3>
<div class="my-4 border relative border-line-structure bg-surface-bg"><div class="flex list-none items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 text-text-primary with-stripes border-b border-line-structure">Where is this feature available?</div><ul class="grid justify-between px-0! my-0! divide-y md:divide-x md:divide-y-0 md:grid-cols-5 grid-cols-1 not-prose"><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Hobby</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Core</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Pro</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Enterprise</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Self Hosted</div><span class="text-xs">Langfuse v3.179.0+</span></li></ul></div>
<p>Retrieve score data (evaluations, annotations, and API-ingested scores) for custom workflows, evaluation pipelines, and analytics. For aggregated score metrics (e.g. average scores grouped by trace name, user, or time period), use the <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/metrics/features/metrics-api">Metrics API</a> instead.</p>
<figure dir="ltr" class="my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes Monokai Pro Light monokai" style="--shiki-light:#2d2a2e;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2;--shiki-light-bg:#fafaf8;--shiki-dark-bg:#272822" tabindex="-1"><div class="empty:hidden absolute top-3 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground" aria-label="Copy Text"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path></svg></button></div><div role="region" tabindex="0" class="text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring" style="--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)"><pre class="min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col"><code><span class="line"><span>GET /api/public/v3/scores</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners callout"><div class="bg-stripe-pattern callout-stripe-fade flex border p-4 gap-2 text-sm text-primary" style="--callout-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted));--stripe-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted))"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" class="size-4 mt-0.5 text-(--callout-color)"><g><path d="M7 12.25C9.8995 12.25 12.25 9.8995 12.25 7C12.25 4.10051 9.8995 1.75 7 1.75C4.10051 1.75 1.75 4.10051 1.75 7C1.75 9.8995 4.10051 12.25 7 12.25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.5625 6.5625C6.67853 6.5625 6.78981 6.60859 6.87186 6.69064C6.95391 6.77269 7 6.88397 7 7V9.1875C7 9.30353 7.04609 9.41481 7.12814 9.49686C7.21019 9.57891 7.32147 9.625 7.4375 9.625" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.78125 5.25C7.14369 5.25 7.4375 4.95619 7.4375 4.59375C7.4375 4.23131 7.14369 3.9375 6.78125 3.9375C6.41881 3.9375 6.125 4.23131 6.125 4.59375C6.125 4.95619 6.41881 5.25 6.78125 5.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-text-secondary text-[14px] prose-no-margin empty:hidden"><p>This section covers reading scores. Scores are created via <code>POST /api/public/scores</code> or the SDK helpers; see <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/evaluation/evaluation-methods/scores-via-sdk">scores via API/SDK</a>. See the <a href="https://api.reference.langfuse.com/#tag/scores/GET/api/public/v3/scores" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal">v3 Scores API reference</a> for the full parameter and response schema.</p></div></div></div></div>
<h4 id="scores-value" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#scores-value"><code>value</code> field</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4>
<p>Every score carries exactly one typed <code>value</code>. Its type is determined by the score&#x27;s <code>dataType</code>:</p>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners"><div class="overflow-auto w-full"><table class="my-0! w-full h-full text-sm caption-bottom border-none"><thead><tr><th><code>dataType</code></th><th><code>value</code> type</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>NUMERIC</code></td><td>number</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>BOOLEAN</code></td><td>boolean</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>CATEGORICAL</code></td><td>string</td><td>The category</td></tr><tr><td><code>TEXT</code></td><td>string</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><code>CORRECTION</code></td><td>string</td><td>Empty string if no correction</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<p>If your pipeline handles mixed score types, branch on <code>dataType</code>.</p>
<h4 id="scores-field-groups" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#scores-field-groups">Selective field retrieval</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4>
<p>Responses always include a lean core (<code>id</code>, <code>projectId</code>, <code>name</code>, <code>value</code>, <code>dataType</code>, <code>source</code>, <code>timestamp</code>, <code>environment</code>, <code>createdAt</code>, <code>updatedAt</code>); opt into additional groups via a comma-separated <code>fields</code> parameter (unknown group names return HTTP 400):</p>
<figure dir="ltr" class="my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes Monokai Pro Light monokai" style="--shiki-light:#2d2a2e;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2;--shiki-light-bg:#fafaf8;--shiki-dark-bg:#272822" tabindex="-1"><div class="empty:hidden absolute top-3 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground" aria-label="Copy Text"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path></svg></button></div><div role="region" tabindex="0" class="text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring" style="--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)"><pre class="min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col"><code><span class="line"><span>?fields=details,subject,annotation</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners"><div class="overflow-auto w-full"><table class="my-0! w-full h-full text-sm caption-bottom border-none"><thead><tr><th>Group</th><th>Fields</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>core</td><td>Always included (see above)</td></tr><tr><td><code>details</code></td><td>comment, configId, metadata</td></tr><tr><td><code>subject</code></td><td>subject (the entity the score is attached to, see below)</td></tr><tr><td><code>annotation</code></td><td>authorUserId, queueId</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<h4 id="scores-subject" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#scores-subject"><code>subject</code> object</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4>
<p>Every score is attached to exactly one entity. Request the <code>subject</code> field group to see which one; it is discriminated by <code>kind</code>:</p>
<figure dir="ltr" class="my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes Monokai Pro Light monokai" style="--shiki-light:#2d2a2e;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2;--shiki-light-bg:#fafaf8;--shiki-dark-bg:#272822" tabindex="-1"><div class="empty:hidden absolute top-3 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground" aria-label="Copy Text"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path></svg></button></div><div role="region" tabindex="0" class="text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring" style="--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)"><pre class="min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2">{ </span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#66D9EF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#66D9EF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">kind</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#66D9EF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#CFCFC2">&quot;observation&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2">, </span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#66D9EF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#66D9EF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">id</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#66D9EF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#CFCFC2">&quot;obs-1&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2">, </span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#66D9EF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#66D9EF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">traceId</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#66D9EF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#CFCFC2">&quot;trace-1&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2D2A2E;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2"> }</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>
<ul>
<li><code>kind: &quot;trace&quot;</code>: <code>id</code> is the trace ID</li>
<li><code>kind: &quot;observation&quot;</code>: <code>id</code> is the observation ID; includes the parent <code>traceId</code></li>
<li><code>kind: &quot;session&quot;</code>: <code>id</code> is the session ID</li>
<li><code>kind: &quot;experiment&quot;</code>: <code>id</code> is the dataset run ID</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="scores-filtering" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#scores-filtering">Filtering</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>Multi-value filters:</strong> most filters accept comma-separated lists (<code>id</code>, <code>name</code>, <code>source</code>, <code>dataType</code>, <code>environment</code>, <code>configId</code>, <code>queueId</code>, <code>authorUserId</code>, <code>traceId</code>, <code>sessionId</code>, <code>observationId</code>, <code>experimentId</code>). Values within one parameter are OR-ed, parameters are AND-ed: <code>name=hallucination,toxicity&amp;source=EVAL</code> returns eval scores named either <code>hallucination</code> or <code>toxicity</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Value filters:</strong> use <code>value</code> for exact matches (comma-separated, requires a single <code>dataType</code> of <code>NUMERIC</code>, <code>BOOLEAN</code>, or <code>CATEGORICAL</code>) or <code>valueMin</code>/<code>valueMax</code> for inclusive numeric range bounds (require <code>dataType=NUMERIC</code>).</li>
<li><strong>Mutual exclusivity:</strong> <code>traceId</code>, <code>sessionId</code>, and <code>experimentId</code> are mutually exclusive. <code>observationId</code> requires <code>traceId</code> because observation IDs are scoped to a trace.</li>
<li><strong>Case-insensitive enums:</strong> <code>source</code> and <code>dataType</code> accept any casing (<code>numeric</code> and <code>NUMERIC</code> are equivalent).</li>
<li><strong>Timestamp bounds:</strong> <code>fromTimestamp</code> is inclusive, <code>toTimestamp</code> is exclusive.</li>
</ul>
<p>Invalid filter combinations are rejected with HTTP 400 rather than silently ignored. Pagination is cursor-based (default 50, max 100); pass the returned <code>meta.cursor</code> back with the same filter parameters to fetch the next page. For recurring full exports to your data warehouse, use the <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/export-to-blob-storage">scheduled blob storage export</a> instead of paginating through the API.</p>
<h4 id="scores-examples" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#scores-examples">Examples</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4>
<p>Pull failing evals within a numeric range:</p>
<figure dir="ltr" class="my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes Monokai Pro Light monokai" style="--shiki-light:#2d2a2e;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2;--shiki-light-bg:#fafaf8;--shiki-dark-bg:#272822" tabindex="-1"><div class="empty:hidden absolute top-3 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground" aria-label="Copy Text"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path></svg></button></div><div role="region" tabindex="0" class="text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring" style="--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)"><pre class="min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#78A855;--shiki-dark:#A6E22E">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF">  -H</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74"> &quot;Authorization: Basic &lt;BASIC AUTH HEADER&gt;&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74">  &quot;https://cloud.langfuse.com/api/public/v3/scores?name=hallucination,toxicity&amp;dataType=NUMERIC&amp;valueMax=0.5&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>
<p>Get scores for specific traces, including what they are attached to:</p>
<figure dir="ltr" class="my-4 bg-fd-card rounded-xl shiki relative border shadow-sm not-prose overflow-hidden text-sm shiki shiki-themes Monokai Pro Light monokai" style="--shiki-light:#2d2a2e;--shiki-dark:#F8F8F2;--shiki-light-bg:#fafaf8;--shiki-dark-bg:#272822" tabindex="-1"><div class="empty:hidden absolute top-3 right-2 z-2 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-lg text-fd-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 hover:text-fd-accent-foreground data-checked:text-fd-accent-foreground" aria-label="Copy Text"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path></svg></button></div><div role="region" tabindex="0" class="text-[0.8125rem] py-3.5 overflow-auto max-h-[600px] fd-scroll-container focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-fd-ring" style="--padding-right:calc(var(--spacing) * 8)"><pre class="min-w-full w-max *:flex *:flex-col"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#78A855;--shiki-dark:#A6E22E">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF">  -H</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74"> &quot;Authorization: Basic &lt;BASIC AUTH HEADER&gt;&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#FC9867;--shiki-dark:#AE81FF"> \</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B58900;--shiki-dark:#E6DB74">  &quot;https://cloud.langfuse.com/api/public/v3/scores?traceId=trace-1,trace-2&amp;fields=details,subject&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div></figure>
<p>The generated SDK clients expose the same endpoint: <code>api.scores.get_many</code> in Python SDK v5+ and <code>api.scores.getMany</code> in JS/TS SDK v6+ (<code>api.scores_v3.get_many_v3</code> / <code>api.scoresV3.getManyV3</code> in earlier versions); see <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/query-via-sdk">Query via SDKs</a>. Score creation uses separate SDK helpers (e.g. <code>create_score</code> in Python); this client is for reads.</p>
<h3 id="experiments" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#experiments">Experiments API</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h3>
<div class="my-4 border relative border-line-structure bg-surface-bg"><div class="flex list-none items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 text-text-primary with-stripes border-b border-line-structure">Where is this feature available?</div><ul class="grid justify-between px-0! my-0! divide-y md:divide-x md:divide-y-0 md:grid-cols-5 grid-cols-1 not-prose"><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Hobby</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Core</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Pro</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Enterprise</div><span class="text-xs">Available</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 relative px-4 py-2 md:py-4 not-prose items-center gap-y-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Self Hosted</div><span class="text-xs">Langfuse v4+</span></li></ul></div>
<p>Retrieve experiment data for analysis, evaluation pipelines, notebooks, and CI/CD workflows. An experiment is a run of your application against test data; each experiment item represents one input, its expected output, and the actual output produced by your application. See the <a href="https://api.reference.langfuse.com/#tag/experiments" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal">Experiments API reference</a> for the full request and response contract.</p>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners"><div class="overflow-auto w-full"><table class="my-0! w-full h-full text-sm caption-bottom border-none"><thead><tr><th>If you want to...</th><th>Use</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Run experiments and ingest experiment data</td><td><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/evaluation/experiments/experiments-via-sdk">Experiment runner SDK</a> or <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/evaluation/experiments/experiments-via-opentelemetry">Experiments via OpenTelemetry</a></td></tr><tr><td>List experiment runs and their summaries</td><td><code>GET /api/public/experiments?fromStartTime=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z</code></td></tr><tr><td>Retrieve experiment items and their inputs, outputs, expected outputs, metadata, and scores</td><td><code>GET /api/public/experiment-items?fromStartTime=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z</code></td></tr><tr><td>Retrieve the complete trace and observation tree for an item</td><td><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="#v2">Observations API v2</a>, using the item&#x27;s <code>traceId</code></td></tr><tr><td>Query evaluation scores independently</td><td><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="#v3">Scores API v3</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<p>The experiment endpoints support filtering, cursor-based pagination, and optional response fields; see the <a href="https://api.reference.langfuse.com/#tag/experiments" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal">Experiments API reference</a> for the available filters and response fields.</p>
<p>Experiment-level scores summarize the complete run, while item-level and trace-level scores evaluate individual experiment items. The Experiments API returns both levels in their corresponding responses; the <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="#v3">Scores API v3</a> is useful when scores are the primary data you want to query. To understand how datasets, experiments, items, traces, observations, and scores relate, see the <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/evaluation/experiments/data-model">Experiments data model</a>.</p>
<h2 id="alternatives" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#alternatives">Alternatives</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<p>You can also export data via:</p>
<ul>
<li><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/query-via-sdk">Query via SDKs</a> - typed Python and JS/TS wrappers for the same endpoints</li>
<li><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/export-from-ui">UI</a> - manual batch-exports from the Langfuse UI</li>
<li><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/export-to-blob-storage">Blob Storage</a> - scheduled automated exports to cloud storage</li>
</ul>
