eness, and other dimensions of your LLM application.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/overview\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/overview.mdx\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"Get Started\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/get-started/online.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Evaluate Production Traffic\",\"description\":\"Score live production traces in Langfuse. Set up an evaluator and a rule to run LLM-as-a-Judge or code checks on incoming observations.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/get-started/online\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/get-started/online.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/get-started/offline.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Evaluate with Datasets\",\"description\":\"Run your first offline evaluation on a Langfuse dataset and compare prompt changes.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/get-started/offline\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/get-started/offline.mdx\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/get-started\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"evaluation/get-started\",\"meta\":\"evaluation/get-started/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/core-concepts.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Concepts\",\"description\":\"Learn the fundamental concepts behind LLM evaluation in Langfuse - Scores, Evaluation Methods, Datasets, and Experiments.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/core-concepts\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/core-concepts.mdx\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"Scores\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/scores/overview.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Overview\",\"description\":\"Scores are Langfuse's universal data object for storing evaluation results. Learn about score types, how to create scores, and when to use them.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/scores/overview\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/scores/overview.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/scores/score-analytics.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Analytics\",\"description\":\"Analyze and compare evaluation scores to validate reliability, uncover insights, and track quality trends in your LLM application. Visualize score distributions, measure agreement between evaluation methods, and monitor scores over time.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/scores/score-analytics\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/scores/score-analytics.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/scores/data-model.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Data Model\",\"description\":\"Data model for Score and ScoreConfig objects in Langfuse.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/scores/data-model\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/scores/data-model.mdx\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/scores\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"evaluation/scores\",\"meta\":\"evaluation/scores/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"Evaluation Methods\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/evaluation-methods/llm-as-a-judge.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"LLM-as-a-Judge\",\"description\":\"Learn how LLM-as-a-Judge evaluation works — use large language models to automatically score, evaluate, and monitor your LLM application outputs at scale with rubric-guided assessments.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/evaluation-methods/llm-as-a-judge\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/evaluation-methods/llm-as-a-judge.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/evaluation-methods/decision-models.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Decision model evaluators\",\"description\":\"Use OpenAI or TypeSafe decision models to ask typed questions about observations and write structured evaluation scores.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/evaluation-methods/decision-models\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/evaluation-methods/decision-models.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/evaluation-methods/code-evaluators.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Code evaluators\",\"description\":\"Use Python or TypeScript code in Langfuse to run deterministic evaluations on observations and experiments.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/evaluation-methods/code-evaluators\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/evaluation-methods/code-evaluators.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/evaluation-methods/annotation-queues.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Annotation Queues\",\"description\":\"Manage your annotation tasks with ease using our new workflow tooling. Create queues, add traces to them, and get a simple UI to review and label LLM application traces in Langfuse.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/evaluation-methods/annotation-queues\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/evaluation-methods/annotation-queues.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/evaluation-methods/scores-via-ui.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Scores via UI\",\"description\":\"Annotate traces and observations with scores in the Langfuse UI to record human-in-the-loop evaluations.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/evaluation-methods/scores-via-ui\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/evaluation-methods/scores-via-ui.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/evaluation-methods/scores-via-sdk.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Scores via API/SDK\",\"description\":\"Ingest custom scores via the Langfuse SDKs or API.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/evaluation-methods/scores-via-sdk\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/evaluation-methods/scores-via-sdk.mdx\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/evaluation-methods\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"evaluation/evaluation-methods\",\"meta\":\"evaluation/evaluation-methods/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"Experiments\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/experiments/data-model.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Data Model\",\"description\":\"Data model for Datasets, DatasetItems, DatasetRuns, DatasetRunItems, and function definitions for Tasks and Evaluators.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/experiments/data-model\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/experiments/data-model.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/experiments/datasets.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Datasets\",\"description\":\"Use Langfuse Datasets to create structured experiments to test and benchmark LLM applications.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/experiments/datasets\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/experiments/datasets.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/experiments/experiments-via-sdk.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Experiments via SDK\",\"description\":\"Start experiments via the Langfuse SDK to programmatically test your application\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/experiments/experiments-via-sdk\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/experiments/experiments-via-sdk.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/experiments/experiments-via-ui.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Experiments via UI\",\"description\":\"Experiment with different prompt versions and models on a dataset and compare the results side-by-side directly from the Langfuse UI.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/experiments/experiments-via-ui\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/experiments/experiments-via-ui.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/experiments/experiments-ci-cd.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Experiments in CI/CD\",\"description\":\"Run Langfuse experiments in CI and gate changes before production.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/experiments/experiments-ci-cd\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/experiments/experiments-ci-cd.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/experiments/experiments-via-opentelemetry.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Experiments via OpenTelemetry\",\"description\":\"Group OpenTelemetry traces as Langfuse experiments by attaching experiment and item attributes.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/experiments/experiments-via-opentelemetry\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/experiments/experiments-via-opentelemetry.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/experiments/compare-experiments.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Compare Experiments\",\"description\":\"Compare application versions against a baseline, inspect individual regressions, and review failures in Langfuse.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/experiments/compare-experiments\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/experiments/compare-experiments.mdx\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/experiments\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"evaluation/experiments\",\"meta\":\"evaluation/experiments/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"More\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/more/agentic-access.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Agent Access\",\"description\":\"Let AI agents work with scores, datasets, experiments, evaluators, and annotation queues through the Agent Skill, CLI, or MCP server.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/more/agentic-access\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/more/agentic-access.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/more/troubleshooting-and-faq.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Troubleshooting and FAQ\",\"description\":\"Troubleshooting and FAQ for Langfuse Evaluation.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/evaluation/more/troubleshooting-and-faq\",\"$ref\":\"evaluation/more/troubleshooting-and-faq.mdx\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation/more\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"evaluation/more\",\"meta\":\"evaluation/more/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:evaluation\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"evaluation\",\"meta\":\"evaluation/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"AI Gateway (beta)\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/overview.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Overview\",\"description\":\"Send OpenAI and Anthropic API calls through Langfuse to trace every model call, keep provider keys in one place, and track cost, with no SDK or code changes.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/gateway/overview\",\"$ref\":\"gateway/overview.mdx\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"Get Started\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/get-started/admin-setup.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Set up Gateway as an admin\",\"description\":\"Set up the Langfuse AI Gateway for an organization. Choose the ingestion project and ingestion mode, add provider credentials, choose models, give your team access, and issue gateway API keys.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/gateway/get-started/admin-setup\",\"$ref\":\"gateway/get-started/admin-setup.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/get-started/first-request.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Send your first request\",\"description\":\"Create a personal gateway API key, connect your coding agent, SDK, or app to the Langfuse AI Gateway, and see your first trace.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/gateway/get-started/first-request\",\"$ref\":\"gateway/get-started/first-request.mdx\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/get-started\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"gateway/get-started\",\"meta\":\"gateway/get-started/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/concepts.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Concepts\",\"description\":\"How the Langfuse AI Gateway routes model calls, which keys and credentials are involved, how a request reaches a model, and how each call becomes a Langfuse trace.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/gateway/concepts\",\"$ref\":\"gateway/concepts.mdx\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"Features\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/features/analytics.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Analytics\",\"description\":\"Track cost, requests, and tokens of the Langfuse AI Gateway per user, API key, and model, and build your own dashboards in the gateway's ingestion project.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/gateway/features/analytics\",\"$ref\":\"gateway/features/analytics.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/features/api-keys.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Authentication\",\"description\":\"Gateway API keys authenticate clients to the Langfuse AI Gateway. Learn the difference between user keys and service account keys, who can create them, when they stop working, and how they set the trace user.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/gateway/features/api-keys\",\"$ref\":\"gateway/features/api-keys.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/features/models.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Model management\",\"description\":\"See which models the Langfuse AI Gateway can call, enable or disable models per provider credential, and choose the right model ID for your client.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/gateway/features/models\",\"$ref\":\"gateway/features/models.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/features/tracing.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Tracing\",\"description\":\"What the Langfuse AI Gateway records for every model call, the FULL and USAGE ingestion modes, where gateway traces are stored, and the request headers that enrich them.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/gateway/features/tracing\",\"$ref\":\"gateway/features/tracing.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/features/rest-api.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"REST API\",\"description\":\"Base URLs, authentication, and endpoints of the Langfuse AI Gateway, including the models endpoints and the OpenAI Responses, OpenAI Chat Completions, and Anthropic Messages APIs.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/gateway/features/rest-api\",\"$ref\":\"gateway/features/rest-api.mdx\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/features\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"gateway/features\",\"meta\":\"gateway/features/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"Integrations\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:_40\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Anthropic SDK ↗\",\"url\":\"/integrations/model-providers/anthropic-gateway\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_41\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Claude Code ↗\",\"url\":\"/integrations/developer-tools/claude-code-gateway\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_42\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Codex ↗\",\"url\":\"/integrations/developer-tools/codex-gateway\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_43\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"GitHub Copilot ↗\",\"url\":\"/integrations/developer-tools/github-copilot-gateway\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_44\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"OpenAI SDK ↗\",\"url\":\"/integrations/model-providers/openai-gateway\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_45\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"OpenCode ↗\",\"url\":\"/integrations/developer-tools/opencode-gateway\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_46\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Pi ↗\",\"url\":\"/integrations/developer-tools/pi-agent-gateway\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_47\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Vercel AI SDK ↗\",\"url\":\"/integrations/frameworks/vercel-ai-sdk-gateway\",\"external\":true}],\"$id\":\"docs:gateway/integrations\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"gateway/integrations\",\"meta\":\"gateway/integrations/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:g