port to PostHog ↗\",\"url\":\"/integrations/analytics/posthog\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_50\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Export to Mixpanel ↗\",\"url\":\"/integrations/analytics/mixpanel\",\"external\":true}],\"$id\":\"docs:metrics/features\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"metrics/features\",\"meta\":\"metrics/features/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:metrics\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"metrics\",\"meta\":\"metrics/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"API \u0026 Data Platform\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:api-and-data-platform/overview.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Overview\",\"description\":\"Langfuse is designed to be extensible and flexible. People using Langfuse are building all kinds of workflows and customizations on top of it. This is powered by our open data platform.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/api-and-data-platform/overview\",\"$ref\":\"api-and-data-platform/overview.mdx\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"Features\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:api-and-data-platform/features/agent-skill.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Agent Skill\",\"description\":\"Install the Langfuse agent skill to give your coding agent access to Langfuse tracing, prompt management, datasets, and documentation — right from the editor.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/agent-skill\",\"$ref\":\"api-and-data-platform/features/agent-skill.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:api-and-data-platform/features/cli.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"CLI\",\"description\":\"Interact with the full Langfuse API from the command line. Built for AI agents and power users.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/cli\",\"$ref\":\"api-and-data-platform/features/cli.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:api-and-data-platform/features/mcp-server.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"MCP Server\",\"description\":\"Native Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for Langfuse, enabling AI assistants to interact with your Langfuse data programmatically.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/mcp-server\",\"$ref\":\"api-and-data-platform/features/mcp-server.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:api-and-data-platform/features/halo.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Halo\",\"description\":\"Use the same Langfuse project tools as external coding agents, directly from the Langfuse UI.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/halo\",\"$ref\":\"api-and-data-platform/features/halo.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:api-and-data-platform/features/export-from-ui.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Export from UI\",\"description\":\"Export your Langfuse observability data from the UI for analysis, fine-tuning, and integration with external tools.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/export-from-ui\",\"$ref\":\"api-and-data-platform/features/export-from-ui.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:api-and-data-platform/features/export-to-blob-storage.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Export to Blob Storage\",\"description\":\"Export enriched observations, scores, and legacy traces and observations to Blob Storage, e.g. S3, GCS, or Azure Blob Storage.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/export-to-blob-storage\",\"$ref\":\"api-and-data-platform/features/export-to-blob-storage.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:api-and-data-platform/features/public-api.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Public API\",\"description\":\"All Langfuse data and features are available via the API. Follow this guide to authenticate, ingest traces, and retrieve observations, scores, and experiments.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/public-api\",\"$ref\":\"api-and-data-platform/features/public-api.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:api-and-data-platform/features/query-via-sdk.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Query via SDKs\",\"description\":\"Query Langfuse data via Python and JS/TS SDKs using the high-performance data APIs.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/api-and-data-platform/features/query-via-sdk\",\"$ref\":\"api-and-data-platform/features/query-via-sdk.mdx\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:api-and-data-platform/features\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"api-and-data-platform/features\",\"meta\":\"api-and-data-platform/features/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:api-and-data-platform\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"api-and-data-platform\",\"meta\":\"api-and-data-platform/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"Administration\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:_51\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Auth\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:administration/authentication-and-sso.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Authentication \u0026 SSO\",\"description\":\"Overview of Single Sign-On (SSO) methods in Langfuse\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/administration/authentication-and-sso\",\"$ref\":\"administration/authentication-and-sso.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:administration/rbac.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Access Control (RBAC)\",\"description\":\"Langfuse offers extensive RBAC capabilities to manage project sharing and permissions across different organizations and projects.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/administration/rbac\",\"$ref\":\"administration/rbac.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:administration/scim-and-org-api.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"SCIM and Org API\",\"description\":\"Langfuse is open and meant to be extended via custom workflows and integrations. You can use these endpoints to automate project and user management on your Langfuse organization.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/administration/scim-and-org-api\",\"$ref\":\"administration/scim-and-org-api.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:_52\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Security\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:administration/audit-logs.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Audit Logs\",\"description\":\"Comprehensive audit logging in Langfuse tracks all system activities with detailed state capture and user attribution for enterprise security and compliance requirements.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/administration/audit-logs\",\"$ref\":\"administration/audit-logs.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:administration/data-deletion.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Data Deletion\",\"description\":\"Delete data from Langfuse\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/administration/data-deletion\",\"$ref\":\"administration/data-deletion.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:administration/data-retention.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Data Retention\",\"description\":\"Configure project data retention and understand what happens to traces, Halo conversations, audit logs, dataset items, experiment results, and media.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/administration/data-retention\",\"$ref\":\"administration/data-retention.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:_53\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Security Docs ↗\",\"url\":\"/security\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_54\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Configuration\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:administration/llm-connection.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"LLM Connections\",\"description\":\"How to set up an LLM connection in Langfuse to use in the Playground or for LLM-as-a-Judge evaluations.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/administration/llm-connection\",\"$ref\":\"administration/llm-connection.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:administration/spend-alerts.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Spend Alerts\",\"description\":\"Get notified when your organization's spend exceeds predefined monetary thresholds to better manage your Langfuse Cloud costs.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/administration/spend-alerts\",\"$ref\":\"administration/spend-alerts.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:_55\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Misc\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:administration/billable-units.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Billable Units\",\"description\":\"Learn how billable units are calculated in Langfuse.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/administration/billable-units\",\"$ref\":\"administration/billable-units.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:administration/troubleshooting-and-faq.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Troubleshooting and FAQ\",\"description\":\"Troubleshooting and FAQ for administering Langfuse.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/administration/troubleshooting-and-faq\",\"$ref\":\"administration/troubleshooting-and-faq.mdx\"}],\"$id\":\"docs:administration\",\"$ref\":{\"folder\":\"administration\",\"meta\":\"administration/meta.json\"},\"icon\":\"$undefined\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:security-and-guardrails.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Security \u0026 Guardrails\",\"description\":\"Comprehensive guide to LLM security guardrails — protect against prompt injection, PII leakage, and harmful content. Learn how to use LLM Guard, NeMo Guardrails, and Langfuse to monitor and evaluate LLM safety.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/security-and-guardrails\",\"$ref\":\"security-and-guardrails.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:compatibility.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Versions \u0026 Compatibility\",\"description\":\"How Langfuse server, SDK, and API versions relate across Langfuse Cloud and self-hosted deployments, including the SDK ↔ server compatibility matrix.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/compatibility\",\"$ref\":\"compatibility.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:_56\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"More\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:demo.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Example Project\",\"description\":\"Try Langfuse in action with a live example project for free. Interact with the chatbot to see new traces and user feedback (👍/👎) in Langfuse. No credit card required.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/demo\",\"$ref\":\"demo.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:glossary.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Glossary\",\"description\":\"A comprehensive glossary of key terms and concepts used in Langfuse documentation.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/glossary\",\"$ref\":\"glossary.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:roadmap.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Roadmap\",\"description\":\"Explore the current product focus areas for Langfuse.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/roadmap\",\"$ref\":\"roadmap.mdx\"},{\"$id\":\"docs:docs-mcp.mdx\",\"type\":\"page\",\"name\":\"Docs MCP Server\",\"description\":\"The Langfuse Docs MCP server exposes the Langfuse documentation to AI agents and coding assistants. How to connect it and which tools it provides.\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"/docs/docs-mcp\",\"$ref\":\"docs-mcp.mdx\"},{\"type\":\"folder\",\"name\":\"SDK \u0026 API References\",\"root\":\"$undefined\",\"defaultOpen\":\"$undefined\",\"description\":\"$undefined\",\"collapsible\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[{\"$id\":\"docs:_57\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"API Reference ↗\",\"url\":\"https://api.reference.langfuse.com\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_58\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"MCP Reference ↗\",\"url\":\"https://mcp.reference.langfuse.com\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_59\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Python SDK ↗\",\"url\":\"https://python.reference.langfuse.com\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_60\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"JS SDK ↗\",\"url\":\"https://js.reference.langfuse.com\",\"external\":true},{\"$id\":\"docs:_61\",\"type\":\"link\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"name\":\"Java SDK ↗\",\"url\":\"https://g